        "status": "approved",
        "source": "Independent expectation recorded in the #364 pre-edit comment (6243928763): the same agreement machinery that accepts 'The girls look' refuses 'Girls looks' (agreement-failure path in the en grammar), so the sentence has no grammatical reading and must refuse rather than guess. CLI-matched at the tm/p364-visual fix tree; the matrix re-asserts it on the pushed head.",
